        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Babylon</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 23rd century BCE – 11th century CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">First mentioned in the reign of the Akkadian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shar-kali-sharri">Shar-Kali-Sharri</a> (2217 to 2193 BCE) as a town of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/akkadian-empire">Akkadian Empire</a>; classical writers gave foundation dates in the 23rd century BCE that <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cuneiform">cuneiform</a> records do not confirm</span></div>
